<script>window.KG={"meta":{"source":"UK Offshore Wind Directory export (verified offshore evidence)","extracted":"2026-10-14","totalProfiles":1520,"offshoreSuppliers":885,"sites":711,"dataNotes":["Fit4Offshore, ORE Catapult Collaboration, Customer Size, export share and export markets were captured as the form's option list, not the chosen value, so they are not used.","Inferred links come from short descriptions (median ~300 characters); absence of a link is not proof a supplier lacks the capability."]},"subsystems":[["RNA","Rotor-nacelle assembly"],["TWR","Tower"],["FND","Foundation & substructure"],["STK","Station-keeping"],["EBP","Electrical balance of plant"]],"components":[["blades","Blades","RNA","both"],["hub_pitch","Hub & pitch system","RNA","both"],["nacelle","Nacelle assembly & housing","RNA","both"],["main_bearing","Main bearing","RNA","both"],["gearbox","Gearbox","RNA","both"],["generator","Generator","RNA","both"],["converter","Power converter","RNA","both"],["turbine_trafo","Turbine transformer","RNA","both"],["yaw","Yaw system","RNA","both"],["cms","Control & condition monitoring","RNA","both"],["tower","Tower structure","TWR","both"],["tower_internals","Tower internals","TWR","both"],["secondary_steel","Secondary steel","TWR","both"],["fasteners","Fasteners & bolting","TWR","both"],["fixed_fnd","Fixed foundations (general)","FND","fixed"],["monopile","Monopile","FND","fixed"],["jacket","Jacket","FND","fixed"],["tp","Transition piece","FND","fixed"],["suction","Suction bucket / pile","FND","both"],["floating_sub","Floating substructure","FND","floating"],["corrosion","Corrosion protection","FND","both"],["scour","Scour protection","FND","fixed"],["mooring","Mooring systems (general)","STK","floating"],["chain","Mooring chain & lines","STK","floating"],["anchors","Anchors","STK","floating"],["connectors","Mooring connectors","STK","floating"],["buoyancy","Buoyancy & load reduction","STK","floating"],["cables","Subsea power cables (general)","EBP","both"],["array_cable","Array cable","EBP","both"],["export_cable","Export cable","EBP","both"],["cable_acc","Cable accessories & protection","EBP","both"],["offshore_sub","Offshore substation","EBP","both"],["hv_equip","HVAC / HVDC equipment","EBP","both"],["onshore_sub","Onshore substation","EBP","both"]],"clusters":["North Scotland","Forth & Tay","Celtic Sea","North East","Humber","Offshore Energy Alliance (OEA)","East Anglia","Solent"],"countries":["United Kingdom","Norway","Netherlands","France","Canada","Germany","United States of America","Denmark","China","Slovenia","Belgium","Australia","United Arab Emirates","Ireland","Italy","Thailand","Spain","Sweden"],"phases":["Develop & consent","Manufacture","Install & commission","Operate & maintain","Decommission"],"primaries":["Professional Services / Consultancy","Installation","Manufacturing / Supplier","Decommissioning","Port / Yard","Research and Innovation","O&M","Rentals / Hire / Charter"],"vesselClasses":[["jackup","Jack-up / turbine installation"],["cable_lay","Cable-lay"],["ctv","Crew transfer (CTV)"],["sov","SOV / walk-to-work"],["rov_dsv","ROV / dive support"],["heavy_lift","Heavy-lift & cranes"],["tug_aht","Tugs & anchor handling"],["guard","Guard & ERRV"],["vessel","Vessel charter (general)"]],"suppliers":[["3T Training Services Limited",0,2,2,0,[],0,[0],"https://www.uowd.co.uk/uowd/view/?id=c9c64486-8960-eb11-89f5-000d3a7ec625","3T Training Services are one of the UK’s leading training providers for the oil & gas, wind, power industries. The training courses cover areas such as survival, working at heights and lifting operations."],["4MS Network Solutions Ltd",32,1,1,0,[0,1],2,[2],"https://www.uowd.co.uk/uowd/view/?id=65c64486-8960-eb11-89f5-000d3a7ec625","4MS Network Solutions Ltd is a privately owned telecommunications and network solutions provider, established in 2007 and headquartered in Aberdeen, Scotland. Specialist in consultancy, design, installation, optimisation, support and managed services for communications infrastructure in corporate and industrial…"],["4Subsea",32,-1,2,1,[0],6,[0],"https://www.uowd.co.uk/uowd/view/?id=3f45aaf0-8b60-eb11-89f5-000d3a7ec5f8","4Subsea provides technology and services that help operators optimise energy production from subsea oil & gas fields and offshore wind farms. They combine domain expertise with data analytics and digital services to maximise lifetime of assets, reduce operational cost and optimise future projects through…"],["7 Steel UK",143,3,3,0,[2],7,[0,1,4],"https://www.uowd.co.uk/uowd/view/?id=291ff0b4-7670-eb11-b1ab-000d3a7ec4d9","7 Steel UK is the nation’s leading producer of low-carbon, circular steel, transforming UK-sourced scrap into high-quality steel products. The group consists of three main divisions Recycling, Manufacturing, and Service. 7 Steel Recycling - Driving Circularity, Securing Supply Chain Resilience : Recycling is at the…"],["80:20 Procurement Services Limited",8,2,1,0,[],3,[0],"https://www.uowd.co.uk/uowd/view/?id=4bc64486-8960-eb11-89f5-000d3a7ec625","80:20 Procurement is a global procurement team specialising in non-strategic, high volume, low-value items as well as ad-hoc procurement. They help clients better manage their tail spend, drive efficiencies with their e-procurement technology and allow buying teams more time to focus on high-value strategic purchasing."],["A & T Enclosures Limited",11,2,2,0,[],7,[0,1],"https://www.uowd.co.uk/uowd/view/?id=71c64486-8960-eb11-89f5-000d3a7ec625","A & T Enclosures design and manufacture bespoke electrical enclosure that conform the the latest international standards. They continually invest in modern technology and perform efficiently in some of the world’s most extreme and demanding environments."],["A Squared Engineering Ltd",10,0,0,0,[],6,[0,1],"https://www.uowd.co.uk/uowd/view/?id=75c64486-8960-eb11-89f5-000d3a7ec625","A Squared Engineering LTD offer several services from transportation to the quayside, lifting onto the vessel, sea fastening for offshore transport."],["A V Dawson",24,2,2,0,[3],3,[0,2,3],"https://www.uowd.co.uk/uowd/view/?id=77c64486-8960-eb11-89f5-000d3a7ec625","AV Dawson is a multimodal freight logistics and port operator based on the River Tees, North East England. The AV Dawson group is made up of a number of subsidiary businesses including Port of Middlesbrough Limited, AV Dawson Transport Limited, AVD Industrial and Port Services Limited and ships agency Cockfield…"],["A Word About Wind Ltd",8,0,0,0,[],7,[0],"https://www.uowd.co.uk/uowd/view/?id=79c64486-8960-eb11-89f5-000d3a7ec625","A Word about wind provides the intelligence, connections and expertise to inspire investment and accelerate the pace of the energy transition. It is part of the Tamarindo group that was founded in 2011, who pioneered the wind information and intelligence space with a fearless spirit and a lofty objective - to lead…"],["A&P Falmouth",24,3,3,0,[],6,[0,3],"https://www.uowd.co.uk/uowd/view/?id=7bc64486-8960-eb11-89f5-000d3a7ec625",""],["A&P Tyne Limited",17,2,2,0,[3],6,[1,2,3],"https://www.uowd.co.uk/uowd/view/?id=7fc64486-8960-eb11-89f5-000d3a7ec625","A&P Tyne boasts the largest commercial dry-dock on the East coast of England as well as two deep water berths and a significant modern fabrication facility complete with panel line, rolling, plasma and gas burning machines. Providing world class ship repair, conversion and fabrication services across the marine and…"],["A.P.I. Engineering Limited",2,1,1,0,[],7,[1],"https://www.uowd.co.uk/uowd/view/?id=81c64486-8960-eb11-89f5-000d3a7ec625","Established in Norfolk, API Engineering serves as a prominent supplier within the heavy engineering sector. For over two decades, they've provided clients with high-quality, competitively priced equipment and components. API Engineering excels in global sourcing and procurement, offering expertise across diverse…"],["AAT Safety",16,0,1,0,[],3,[3],"https://www.uowd.co.uk/uowd/view/?id=89c64486-8960-eb11-89f5-000d3a7ec625","AAT are a UK based company specialising in the sale, hire, installation, repair and maintenance of lifting, pressure and safety equipment within wind turbines and meteorological masts."],["ABB Limited",41,3,3,-1,[],3,[0,1],"https://www.uowd.co.uk/uowd/view/?id=8bc64486-8960-eb11-89f5-000d3a7ec625","ABB is a technology leader in electrification and automation, enabling a more sustainable and resource-efficient future. The company’s solutions connect engineering know-how and software to optimize how things are manufactured, moved, powered and operated."],["Abbott Risk Consulting Ltd. (ARC)",8,2,2,0,[0],6,[0],"https://www.uowd.co.uk/uowd/view/?id=8fc64486-8960-eb11-89f5-000d3a7ec625","Abbott Risk Consulting provides a variety of risk management and engineering consultancy services for companies in the energy, defence, mining and rail sectors."],["Aberdeen Harbour Board",64,2,2,0,[0],2,[0,2],"https://www.uowd.co.uk/uowd/view/?id=5545aaf0-8b60-eb11-89f5-000d3a7ec5f8","Our South Harbour will provide the space-hungry renewable industry with much needed facilities to support the development and maintenance of offshore windfarms."],["Aberdeen Web Ltd",1,0,1,0,[0],7,[1],"https://www.uowd.co.uk/uowd/view/?id=99c64486-8960-eb11-89f5-000d3a7ec625","Aberdeen Web Ltd are one of the UK's leading manufacturers of webbing slings, round slings and ratchet systems. For over 30 years they have been providing lifting equipment to companies throughout the world. Their testing facilities ensures that slings are made to the highest of standards. Aberdeen Web operates…"],["Aberystwyth University - Institute of Geography & Earth Sciences",128,-1,2,0,[],5,[0],"https://www.uowd.co.uk/uowd/view/?id=051ff0b4-7670-eb11-b1ab-000d3a7ec4d9","The Institute of Geography & Earth Sciences at Aberystwyth University is a leading department for education, research, and innovation in the fields of geography and earth sciences."],["ABFAD",25,0,0,-1,[],3,[0,1,3],"https://www.uowd.co.uk/uowd/view/?id=9bc644