ed to facilitate welfare-first fish farming as well as reducing its environmental impact."],["ACE Winches",19,2,2,0,[0],2,[1,2,3],"https://www.uowd.co.uk/uowd/view/?id=3945aaf0-8b60-eb11-89f5-000d3a7ec5f8","ACE Winches are a leader in the design, manufacture and hire of lifting, pulling and deploying solutions in a wide range of applications including shore approach, topside and jacket installation, pipe pull, riser installations and much more."],["Acorn Industrial Services Limited",2,2,2,0,[],3,[1],"https://www.uowd.co.uk/uowd/view/?id=b1c64486-8960-eb11-89f5-000d3a7ec625","ACORN is one of the largest stockists of bearings, linear motion systems, power transmission products and maintenance equipment in Europe."],["Acrastyle Limited",1,2,2,0,[],3,[1],"https://www.uowd.co.uk/uowd/view/?id=b5c64486-8960-eb11-89f5-000d3a7ec625","Acrastyle is an engineering company which designs, manufactures, tests, installs, commissions and maintains high-voltage sub-station protection and control equipment for the utilities, renewables, industrial and transportation sectors, with a focus on providing bespoke solutions tailored to each client's specific…"],["Acteon Group Limited",25,3,3,0,[0],6,[0,1,3],"https://www.uowd.co.uk/uowd/view/?id=b9c64486-8960-eb11-89f5-000d3a7ec625","Acteon supports marine projects for the offshore renewable energy, nearshore construction and oil and gas industries by delivering services with demonstrable commercial and environmental benefits which are enabling the energy transition. Providing specialist services and innovative products to major contractors and…"],["Admiral Harding Limited",8,2,2,0,[],2,[0],"https://www.uowd.co.uk/uowd/view/?id=c5c64486-8960-eb11-89f5-000d3a7ec625","Admiral Harding is a global supplier of goods and services to the shipping industry, including cruise, offshore renewables, military, and merchant vessels."],["Advanced Innergy Ltd",0,1,1,0,[],0,[],"https://www.uowd.co.uk/uowd/view/?id=cbc64486-8960-eb11-89f5-000d3a7ec625","AIS 